                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I stood with @RonWyden & @RepDexterOR to call out Republicans\u2019 Big, Ugly Bill, which blocks OHP (Medicaid) payments to @PPFA for a year.\n\nThe reality is that 60% of @PPFA patients in #OR rely on OHP for vital services like cancer screenings.\n\nThis is an all-out attack on women, and I'll fight back until they have full access to the health care they deserve.",
