                "text": "Yesterday, I toured #Aumsville Clinic to speak directly with the providers and patients on the front lines in our rural communities.\n\nMedicare and Medicaid cover countless rural patients. Republicans\u2019 cuts could shutter rural clinics like this one, leaving Oregonians with nowhere else to turn.",
